  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WATER SUPPLY PROJECT IN NORTH EASTERN PARTS OF ALGERIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO COPE THE SHORTAGE OF POTABLE WATER IN COLLO AND GUENITRA AREAS IN NORTH EASTERN PARTS OF ALGERIA. THE PROJECT WILL RAISE THE AVERAGE SUPPLY PER CAPITAL FROM THE PRESENT 20 TO L4 L/PER/DAY TO SOMEWHAT NEAR THE INT&apos;L STANDARD _ WHO FOR SIMILAR AREAS.</narrative>
  </description>
